54:00.740 --> 54:01.620
the empirical fact

54:01.620 --> 54:02.640
that freezing almost

54:02.640 --> 54:03.480
the whole model

54:03.480 --> 54:03.920
and training

54:03.920 --> 54:05.140
just one middle layer

54:05.140 --> 54:06.520
can match

54:06.520 --> 54:07.180
