54:12.420 --> 54:13.100
more mathematically

54:13.100 --> 54:14.480
or that they were simply

54:14.480 --> 54:15.820
the most necessary parts

54:15.820 --> 54:16.700
of the forward pass.

54:17.020 --> 54:17.580
We translated

54:17.580 --> 54:18.780
the elegant math

54:18.780 --> 54:20.940
of the repair set formalism,

54:21.340 --> 54:22.580
balancing the improvement

54:22.580 --> 54:23.920
epsilon against

54:23.920 --> 54:24.840
the damaged delta.

54:25.120 --> 54:25.680
And we saw

54:25.680 --> 54:26.800
how that math explains

54:26.800 --> 54:27.660
why joint training

54:27.660 --> 54:28.780
can sometimes actually

54:28.780 --> 54:29.860
poison a model

54:29.860 --> 54:31.500
if it blindly searches

54:31.500 --> 54:32.020
and layers

54:32.020 --> 54:33.260
with poor repair sets.

54:33.500 --> 54:33.700
Yes.

54:33.980 --> 54:34.660
We explored

54:34.660 --> 54:35.740
the composition puzzle,

54:36.160 --> 54:36.880
finding that even

54:36.880 --> 54:38.460
